      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Groups\nOur main dining room can take groups of up to 8 people. For groups larger than that we have a shared banquet table with stools or you can opt for a more elevated experience in our Parlour space away from the main dining room.",
        "spans": [
          {
            "type": "strong",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 6
          }
        ],
        "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Length of Bookings\nGhost Street is a relatively small restaurant so during busy shifts tables are only bookable for certain lengths of time;\nUp to 4 people - 1.75 hours\n5 or 6 people - 2 hours\n7 or more - 2.25 hours\nIf you feel that this length of time is unsuitable please contact us on eat@ghoststreetakl.nz and we will try to accommodate your requirements.",
        "spans": [
          {
            "type": "strong",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 18
          }
        ],
        "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "All public holidays incur a 15% public holiday surcharge.",
        "spans": [],
        "direction": "ltr"
      }
    ],
    "show_booking_widget": true
  },
  "page:private-events": {
    "meta_title": "Private Events",
    "meta_description": "",
    "title": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "text": "Private Events / The Parlour",
        "spans": [],
        "direction": "ltr"
      }
    ],
    "side_image": {
      "id": "tlr-VxSFtvV7RfJA",
      "alt": null
    },
    "body": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "The Parlour is our private dining room situated above Ghost Street.",
        "spans": [],
        "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "It offers two menu options; Northern Vietnamese from our award-winning Cafe Hanoi or rustic Chinese from Ghost Street. The room holds up to 44 people seated and 50 people standing.",
        "spans": [],
        "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Please go to theparlour.nz to find out more or to book.",
        "spans": [
          {
            "type": "hyperlink",
            "data": {
              "link_type": "Web",
              "url": "http://theparlour.nz"
            },
            "start": 13,
            "end": 26
          }
        ],
        "direction": "ltr"
      }
    ],
    "show_booking_widget": false
  },
